+
+`VERDICT: APPROVED` or `VERDICT: CHANGES_REQUIRED`
+
+`P0_P1_UNION: none` or a comma-separated finding-title list
+
+`D109C_RED_MAY_START: yes` or `D109C_RED_MAY_START: no`
